perience the mind-blowing dramatic fun?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/7d3f9670e76776f5f29e0696c52cf56e.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" width=618 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/7d3f9670e76776f5f29e0696c52cf56e.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/7d3f9670e76776f5f29e0696c52cf56e.mp4?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Random Arena Scene with Over 100 Strategies Combinations 】</h2>Randomly generated arena enables over a hundred different strategies! The game is full of various Roguelike elements such as random hexagon tiles (grass, snow, water, etc.) , on top of which different obstacles or hidden elements will be randomly generated, and a few treasure chests awaits being mined! Even if your opponent is currently the advantageous party in the match, the random events such as Rainfall will disrupt the current rhythm of the battle and may benefit you, so let's bring the strongest brain and heart and turns the table!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/efa76037dba3d152f8cb64dd97cfc955.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" width=618 height=333 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/efa76037dba3d152f8cb64dd97cfc955.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Get Started in Three Minutes, Five Minutes to Reach the Climax】</h2>Strategy is more important than fancy operations! No complicated finger movement is needed , just move your little finger, and you can control the whole field! Predicting the opponent's hidden location, placing your traps and make your moves quickly to kill off the opponents. You can start the game anytime, anywhere, 5 minutes to meet the climax of the game, 10 minutes to play again!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/31ff8b30de4d9dc0fd9fac1222eef7a0.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" width=618 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/31ff8b30de4d9dc0fd9fac1222eef7a0.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/31ff8b30de4d9dc0fd9fac1222eef7a0.mp4?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >【Friends Playing Tricks, Team Party Doubling the Fun】</h2>Forest pranksters assemble! The correct way to play casual mode is to &quot;set your teammates up&quot;, setting traps and playing gimmicks on each other to the last moment of the match ~ , guarantees easy recreation. While in compete ranking mode, teammates will need to team up, one detect the location opponents' location, and the other throws the pine cone to attack, so that the opponents will have nowhere to hide!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/e1227b1ef0b1af3ee0af38d2a305bc64.poster.avif?t=1731030168\" width=618 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/e1227b1ef0b1af3ee0af38d2a305bc64.webm?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991910/extras/e1227b1ef0b1af3ee0af38d2a305bc64.mp4?t=1731030168\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v